<title>USA: Perry's Majestic Beer buys Mass. brewer.</title>
<headline>Perry's Majestic Beer buys Mass. brewer.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKLYN, N.Y. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beer brewing, marketing and sales company Perry's Majestic Beer Inc said on Friday it bought the assets of Old Marlborough Brewing Co, a small Massachusetts brewery.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment on the purchase price.</p>
<p>The acquisition included rights to produce and market Marlborough's Post Road Pale Ale, a so-called microbrewed beer distributed throughout Massachusetts.</p>
<p>Perry's beer is distributed in 10 states, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
